<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Update - CutePDF Writer - 3.1.0.3 - Windows (x64)</Title>
    <Description>This fixlet is for Update - CutePDF Writer - 3.1.0.3 - Windows and was generated by William Easton as part of the C3 Patch offering. Access to this content is granted for free. If you make improvements to this fixlet please share them on BigFix.Me or on the orginal content on BigFix.Me. If you have paid for access to this content or if you have issues with this fixlet please contact Strawgate on forum.bigfix.com or comment on this piece of content on BigFix.Me.
&lt;h3&gt;CutePDF Writer Fixlet Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do not update GhostScript prior to updating CutePDF Writer, the CutePDF Writer installer may attempt to download and install GhostScript itself as part of installation. This may fail if the computer does not have internet connectity. To avoid this, update GhostScript before CutePDF Writer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Manual BES Caching&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This fixlet &lt;b&gt;requires manual caching&lt;/b&gt;. You can obtain the installer here: http://www.cutepdf.com/download/CuteWriter.exe with instructions on manual bes caching available here: http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21506080&lt;/p&gt;
</Description>
    <Relevance>(windows of operating system) and (x64 of operating system) and (version of operating system &gt;= &quot;6.1&quot;) and (if exists property &quot;in proxy agent context&quot; then ( not in proxy agent context ) else true) and (free space of drive of client &gt; 2835520 * 2) and (exists value &quot;DisplayVersion&quot; whose (it as string as version &lt; &quot;3.1.0.3&quot;) of keys whose (value &quot;DisplayName&quot; of it as string is &quot;CutePDF Writer Installation&quot;) of keys &quot;HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall&quot; of (x32 registries; x64 registries))</Relevance>
